                <note rend="inline" type="source">C.P.(Gen)Doc.1.J.25.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Article 20</hi></head>
                <dateline>
                    <date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-outside-research" calendar="gregorian"
                        notAfter="1946-10-15T23:59:59+01:00" notBefore="1946-07-29T00:00:00+01:00"
                        >undated</date>
                </dateline>
                <p>Delete the second sentence of Article 20 from the words “but, taking into
                    consideration …” to the end and substitute the following: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“<hi rendition="#italic">This indemnity shall be fixed at … United States
                                dollars in the case of Greece and … United States dollars in the
                                case of Yugoslavia payable over … years</hi>.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
            </div>
